<title>UK: Bodycote buys remaining stake in Hauzer.</title>
<headline>Bodycote buys remaining stake in Hauzer.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Bodycote International Plc said on Tuesday it had bought the remaining 49 percent of Hauzer Industries BZ of Venlo in the Netherlands for 5.76 million stg.</p>
<p>Bodycote bought 51 percent of Hauzer on May 1 and had an option to buy the rest of the company on a profit-related formula.</p>
<p>It satisfied the purchase of the 49 percent stake with cash and shares.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
